You noted that very big nations dominate the scenario. Their influence is built on their ability to protect—or threaten—others.

The "Protocol" Neutralizer: By establishing "International Protocol Zones" (your artificial islands/cosmopolitan villages), you create spaces that are independently secure. They don't need a superpower's military protection because they are secured by the collective consensus of the entire global network.

